{"title":"Sirocco Core","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: The Howling Sirocco, Dust Devil, Sand Devil</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>An <b>enchant reagent</b>. Each <b>infuse</b> (one carat more) and each <b>re-enchant</b> to one of these uses one:</p><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>of the Leopard</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Iolite + Pearl + any gem)</span></li><li><b>Pearl rings and pendants</b> <span class=\"muted\">(their gem: <a href=\"#/item/gem-pearl\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a8e7d0e0c97b577cea1a.svg\" alt=\"\">Gem Pearl</a>)</span></li></ul><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Dust Devil</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/dust-devil\">Dust Devil</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\">Sand Devil</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">Sirocco</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"The Howling Sirocco - dropped it in 14 of 296 looted corpses (1/21)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Howling Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/21<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - dropped it in 1 of 66 looted corpses (1/66)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/66<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - dropped it in 1 of 283 looted corpses (1/283)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/283<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"sirocco-core\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/427c7901fb103b102026.svg\" alt=\"Sirocco Core\"></div><h3>Sirocco Core</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/17/2026, 7:30:43 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}